    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n61018" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κυπτάζω</span></b> , Frequentat. of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύπτω</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>keep
